title: Purchased
---
<<lookat painting>>

<<set $dice = dice(10)>>
<<if $askingPrice > ($actualValue + 100)>>
    {$npcName}: Ha! Sucker
<<elseif $dice == 1>>
    {$npcName}: I feel a little cheated...
<<elseif $dice == 2>>
    {$npcName}: Enjoy!
<<elseif $dice == 3>>
    {$npcName}: I'm just glad to be rid of it!
<<elseif $dice == 4>>
    {$npcName}: *mumble* Should have asked for ${$askingPrice + 25} *mumble* 
<<elseif $dice == 5>>
    {$npcName}: No taksies backies! 
<<elseif $dice == 6>>
    {$npcName}: If the cops call, you've never heard of me! 
<<elseif $dice == 7>>
    {$npcName}: I'm sad to see it go, but glad to have this money, funny how life goes, huh? 
<<elseif $dice == 8>>
    {$npcName}: Good riddance to old junk! 
<<elseif $dice == 9>>
    {$npcName}: Maybe I shouldn't have sold it after all... 
<<elseif $dice == 10>>
    {$npcName}: Awesome, now it can make someone <i>elses</i> house look tacky!
<<endif>>

<<purchase>>
===










title: StormOut
---
<<lookat npc-camera-target>>

{$npcName}: Screw this!
<<storm_out>>
===




title: Leaves
---
<<lookat npc-camera-target>>

{$npcName}: Oh... OK...
<<storm_out>>
===